    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d103">

                <pb facs="0163" n="79" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp02/pg79"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 362.11/5334</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Switzerland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Stovall</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Berne</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-05-29T14:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 29, 1918, 2 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received May 30, 9.30 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3499. Legation’s 3469, May 25.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d103-f1"/> Certificate from
                    Embassy’s doctor, optical division, at Jaryour [<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >sic</hi>], states in case of Corpl. Edward Roberts: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Right eye entirely gone, left eye partially saved by hasty operation so
                            that Roberts can now distinguish moving objects and
                            persons. He is out of bed and in good health. To be given education for
                            blind.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p>As certificate states Roberts subject for repatriation, have
                    asked Spanish Embassy, Berlin, to take steps to secure repatriation, although no
                    agreement yet exists between two Governments. This only one case of several
                    which are eligible for immediate repatriation. Recommend agreement this subject
                    be arranged at the earliest practical moment.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stovall</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
